{% if render_mode == "stable" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform" or (render_mode == "full" and not default(stable_split, false)) %}
{# Quests this companion saw at the player's side: quest_awareness's lines, "" without a record (records are made only for
   rostered followers, so no follower test). The decorator returns the body; this file owns the heading. Ships with that DLL. #}
{% if actorUUID and actorUUID != 0 %}
{% set quest_ctx = quest_awareness(actorUUID) %}
{% if quest_ctx != "" %}
## Quests You Witnessed
You were there with {{ player.name }} when these unfolded:
{{ quest_ctx }}
Speak of these as things you saw with your own eyes. Let them come up when they fit the conversation rather than volunteering them.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
